忱。江东虽小，亦知天命所归，愿与魏公休战修好，共享太平。 决策理由：建业仅余1兵极危，从吴郡调3兵回防都城，使建业达4兵可保根本。魏蜀同盟本回合已到期，魏方克复许昌后战略目标已就，值此窗口提议停战。；密谋揭晓：暗中寻求议和"},{"id":30127,"turn":62,"type":"diplomacy_response","factionId":"wei","message":"魏拒绝了 蜀 的联合进攻提议"},{"id":30128,"turn":62,"type":"joint_attack_proposed","factionId":"wei","message":"魏 向 吴 提议共同进攻 蜀"},{"id":30129,"turn":62,"type":"alliance_proposed","factionId":"shu","message":"蜀 向 魏 提议结盟"},{"id":30130,"turn":62,"type":"recruit","factionId":"wei","message":"魏 在宛城征募 2 兵力"},{"id":30131,"turn":62,"type":"mobilize","factionId":"shu","message":"蜀向江州战略集结 3 兵"},{"id":30132,"turn":62,"type":"transfer","factionId":"wu","message":"吴 从吴郡向建业调动 3 兵力","payload":{"sourceCityId":"wujun","targetCityId":"jianye","troops":3}},{"id":30133,"turn":63,"type":"administration_paid","factionId":"wei","message":"魏 支付行政成本 2 金、2 粮"},{"id":30134,"turn":63,"type":"resource_overflow","factionId":"wei","message":"魏 库存溢出，损失 4 金、0 粮"},{"id":30135,"turn":63,"type":"resource_overflow","factionId":"shu","message":"蜀 库存溢出，损失 7 金、17 粮"},{"id":30136,"turn":63,"type":"administration_paid","factionId":"wu","message":"吴 支付行政成本 2 金、2 粮"},{"id":30137,"turn":63,"type":"resource_overflow","factionId":"wu","message":"吴 库存溢出，损失 0 金、6 粮"},{"id":30138,"turn":63,"type":"turn_prepared","factionId":null,"message":"第 63 回合（决战阶段）收入与维持已结算"}],"createdAt":"2026-08-18T14:23:07.534Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-18T16:07:53.130Z","exportedAt":"2026-08-18T16:08:08.891Z"}